---
import { Image, Picture } from 'astro:assets';
import myImage from '../../assets/placeholder.png';
---

<section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto p-4 border border-zinc-800 rounded-lg bg-zinc-900 my-10">
  <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-zinc-100 mb-4">Teste de Pipeline de Assets (Sharp)</h2>
  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
    <div class="bg-black p-4 rounded-md border border-zinc-800">
      <h3 class="text-zinc-400 mb-2 text-sm uppercase font-mono tracking-wider">Otimização AVIF Fixa</h3>
      <!-- Aspect ratio explícito para Zero CLS -->
      <Image 
        src={myImage} 
        alt="Imagem de teste processada via Sharp" 
        width={400} 
        height={300} 
        format="avif"
        class="w-full h-auto aspect-video object-cover rounded shadow-lg opacity-80 hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity"
      />
    </div>
    <div class="bg-black p-4 rounded-md border border-zinc-800">
      <h3 class="text-zinc-400 mb-2 text-sm uppercase font-mono tracking-wider">Srcset Dinâmico (Picture)</h3>
      <Picture 
        src={myImage} 
        alt="Imagem de teste com Múltiplos Formatos" 
        formats={['avif', 'webp']} 
        fallbackFormat="png"
        widths={[240, 540, 720]}
        sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 50vw"
        class="w-full h-auto aspect-video object-cover rounded shadow-lg opacity-80 hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity"
      />
    </div>
  </div>
  <p class="text-zinc-500 text-xs mt-4 font-mono">
    [Ghost-Architect]: Se as imagens renderizarem, o pipeline nativo Astro com Sharp está configurado para AVIF/WebP com Zero CLS.
  </p>
</section>
